      "properties": {
        "reported": true,
        "property_type": "magnetic",
        "summary": "χMT at 300 K is 53.36 cm3 K mol−1 (expected 56.6 for four DyIII). χMT decreases to 45.8 at ~10 K and 38.2 at 2 K, consistent with Stark depopulation and weak antiferromagnetic Dy···Dy coupling. Magnetization at 2 K and 70 kG is 20.9 μB without saturation, indicating anisotropy. Zero-field ac χ″ is frequency-dependent below 6 K without peaks (fast QTM). Under 1000 Oe, slow relaxation appears below 15 K with χ′/χ″ peaks at 1200 Hz. Estimated Ea ≈ 2.3 K and τ0 ≈ 9.4×10−5 s.",
